  "goodToKnow": "Der Ausbilder (die Ausbilderin) is a trainer or instructor, especially of apprentices in Germany's dual system. To train apprentices, companies need a qualified Ausbilder, usually with the AdA certificate (Ausbildung der Ausbilder). Also: der Fahrlehrer (driving instructor). Ausbilden means to train, and die Ausbildung is vocational training. In sport, the word is Trainer. Plural: die Ausbilder."
